  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: bf2d7532251303545ab78ab68b00d5cf, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lobby_OpeningBriefing
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sequenceId: Lobby_OpeningBriefing
  notes: 'Lobby opening briefing; movement and view are locked. Source: HEARTH_Full_Game_Script_No_Audio_Tags_Native_English.md,
    stable marker Lobby_OpeningBriefing. Text is synchronized by Tools/Hearth/Dialogue/Sync
    All Dialogue From Final Script.'
  lines:
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.15
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Good evening, Inspector. Field Companion Unit online. I'll be your partner
      tonight.
    holdSeconds: 5.678302
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Mia
    text: All right.
    holdSeconds: 2.2
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: You are one of HEARTH's most highly regarded inspectors. Tonight, three
      household companion units on the seventeenth floor are scheduled for review.
    holdSeconds: 9.451886
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: You will check how each unit has been operating, identify any problems,
      and decide whether its household-use strategy should be adjusted.
    holdSeconds: 9.074528
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: 'One additional detail: the seventeenth floor is also where you live.'
    holdSeconds: 5.3009434
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Before you begin, you may observe how residents are using companion units
      throughout the lobby.
    holdSeconds: 6.810377
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: "These are our flagship products\u2014and the most successful companion
      technology in the world."
    holdSeconds: 6.0556602
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: When you're ready, use the assignment terminal to load tonight's inspection
      files.
    holdSeconds: 5.678302
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  postSequenceDelay: 0.18
